    {
      "_id": "whbArmHiveShel01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "蜂巢甲壳",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>全身覆着蜂巢状硬化壳。你拥有对钝击、穿刺、挥砍的<strong>抗性 4</strong>，以及对<strong>精密</strong>伤害的抗性 5（普通「爆头」式精密一击很难一击致命）。</p>\n<p>每当你受到火焰伤害时，甲壳焦裂：直至你下一回合结束，上述物理抗性降为 0（精密抗性仍保留 2）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbArmStagger001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp",
      "name": "甲壳震荡",
      "sort": 520000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "free" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 你被近战 Strike 命中</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 沉重甲壳被震得一滞：你获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{笨拙 1}，持续至你下一回合结束。近战是拆壳的好办法。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
